menu "SOS delivery sender task"

config EGOLINK_SOS_DELIVERY_SENDER_TASK_ENABLED
    bool "Enable the independent SOS delivery sender owner"
    default n
    help
        Default-off Productization Sprint 1 integration seam. When an
        explicitly selected composition root enables it, one statically
        allocated task runs only the split-phase sender path. It neither owns
        GPIO nor creates credentials, a network bearer, a Call session, or a
        second SOS/outbox contract.

endmenu
